sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant UI as Login page
  participant API as POST /api/auth/login
  participant PG as PostgreSQL (role bookstore_app)

  U->>UI: e-mail and password
  UI->>API: JSON body
  API->>API: CSRF guard, validate input
  API->>PG: fn_get_login(email)
  alt unknown e-mail
    API->>API: burnPasswordCheck() same time as a real check
    API-->>UI: 401 Invalid e-mail or password
  else known account
    PG-->>API: hash, status, locked_until
    alt locked or suspended
      API-->>UI: 429 or 403
    else password wrong
      API->>PG: fn_record_login(false), count towards 5 failures
      API-->>UI: 401 Invalid e-mail or password
    else password correct
      API->>PG: fn_record_login(true), fn_get_session_user()
      API-->>UI: 200 + Set-Cookie bk_session (HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, 60 min JWT)
    end
  end
  Note over UI,PG: Every later request re-reads the role from PostgreSQL, so suspension and role changes apply at once
